<title>BELGIUM: European truckers in protest ride through Brussels.</title>
<headline>European truckers in protest ride through Brussels.</headline>
<dateline>BRUSSELS 1996-11-07</dateline>
<text>
<p>Belgian police said on Thursday it expected a protest by truckers from several European countries demanding a tax rebate on fuel from the European Union to disrupt evening rush hour traffic.</p>
<p>A spokeswoman for the Belgian truckers' federation said that around 1600 GMT (1700 local) 50 to 70 trucks would drive from Rond Point Schuman, in the EU district, to the European Commission's Transport Directorate on Avenue de Beaulieu.</p>
<p>There a delegation of truckers from Belgium, Italy, Spain, France and the Netherlands, will deliver a package of claims.</p>
</text>
